# Build output, regenerated by prebuild before every deploy. Tracking these
# only creates drift and merge conflicts: posts published through /admin commit
# markdown ONLY — the CMS never runs a build — so the copies in git go stale
# the moment anyone publishes, while the deployed files are always correct.
# The markdown in content/blog and the catalogue in trainings.ts are the source
# of truth; these three are derived from them.
src/data/blog.generated.json
public/rss.xml
public/sitemap.xml

